+# Official Base v1.5.1 binary: staged, verified, validated offline (RESULT-BINARY-PREFLIGHT, 2026-10-23 ~06:35Z)
+
+**Status:** the pinned official binary is staged and verified. Every rendered argument and environment semantic was
+checked against it offline, and the launcher was fixed where the real binary disagreed with it.
+
+**Not done:** no installation, no system unit, no mount, no cache allocation, no chain sync, no snapshot or state
+download, no SSH, no sudo, no production change and no push.
+
+**Not activation-ready.** The open gates are in §6. **This is not RPC independence.**
+
+**Commits** (`work/fresh-witness-supply`, all SteveDeFacto; root's two are cherry-picked with `-x`):
+
+| Commit | Content |
+|---|---|
+| `ea504aa` | binary staging, flag validation, removal of `--minimal`, review mode, the offline fixture. Amended before any push to drop a stray test `l2_jwt.hex`; it is in no commit |
