+**Source of truth.** The asset URL and size come from the already-recorded GitHub release metadata
+(`evidence/upstream-20261023T043317Z/base-releases.json`, sha256 `9def1621…`; release id 421013843, tag v1.5.1).
+
+| Item | Value |
+|---|---|
+| tarball | `base-v1.5.1-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz`, **53,031,200 B**, sha256 **`6779c45dbc6041205cc4e52bc2cd9d40746a5a4366a309899bf6533fccebe2b7`** (= the published asset digest; the `.sha256` sidecar agrees) |
+| sidecars | `.sha256` (110 B, `dd50e081…`); `.asc` (833 B, `bcd3c7c0…`). **The signature was NOT verified**: no Base release key is established |
+| archive members | exactly one: `base`, a regular file, mode 0755, 153,601,320 B |
