+
+**How it was staged** (`tools/stage_release.py` `9e29d2bc…`, queue 256, peak 37 MiB):
+- streamed to a NEW gitignored directory, `staging/base-v1.5.1-20261023T053947Z/`;
+- size refused above the recorded size, with a 1 GiB total cap;
